that a princess

285
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:56,290
was bullied by you servants and started bleeding,

286
00:16:56,290 --> 00:16:56,910
♪ Years flow through the wilderness, unwilling to forgive mistakes ♪

287
00:16:56,910 --> 00:16:57,630
guess

288
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:58,920
if His Majesty

289
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:00,190
will care or not?

290
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:01,490
Let's go.

291
00:17:03,020 --> 00:17:04,069
♪ It's my fault for not protecting the vow well ♪

292
00:17:04,069 --> 00:17:04,930
Fine, let's go.

293
00:17:06,450 --> 00:17:07,349
Are you okay?

294
00:17:09,810 --> 00:17:13,440
♪ Counting sorrows one by one, hard to help each other in hardship ♪

295
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:14,770
Mind your own business.

296
00:17:16,430 --> 00:17:21,540
♪ There will be a pure land to banish our karma ♪

297
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:27,310
♪ I don't want to have it engraved on my heart only when the vanity ends ♪

298
00:17:27,310 --> 00:17:28,109
You…

299
00:17:28,109 --> 00:17:29,650
Don't die.

300
00:17:29,650 --> 00:17:30,200
♪ Grey hair, fading dusk, still can't see through fate ♪

301
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,830
I can't drag you.

302
00:17:36,190 --> 00:17:36,920
♪ After many struggles, I finally know what a pure heart means ♪

303
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:37,790
You're awake.

304
00:17:38,510 --> 00:17:39,590
You scared me.

305
00:17:39,590 --> 00:17:41,350
I thought you'd never wake up.

306
00:17:42,300 --> 00:17:45,270
♪ Wandering for three lifetimes, waiting for a glance from you in 1,000 years ♪

307
00:17:45,270 --> 00:17:45,930
Don't move.

308
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:48,820
You'll need to rest for quite a while to recover.

309
00:17:48,870 --> 00:17:49,640
♪ Distant hills fade into the way home, bringing you morning bells and drums ♪

310
00:17:49,640 --> 00:17:51,440
I'll go get you something to eat.

311
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:52,410
Here, take this.

312
00:17:52,510 --> 00:17:54,640
If you're thirsty, hungry, or in pain,

313
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:55,760
you can blow the whistle to call me.

314
00:17:55,760 --> 00:18:01,390
♪ The story paints across the mountains, leaving a fairyland scene ♪

315
00:18:02,490 --> 00:18:03,480
♪ Where the flowers fall, thankfully the fragrance of my heart remains ♪

316
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:04,810
You're thirsty, right?

317
00:18:05,510 --> 00:18:07,310
Why didn't you blow the whistle?

318
00:18:07,510 --> 00:18:08,680
You're not hungry, are you?

319
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,440
♪ Wasting my youth, waiting for a glance from you in 1,000 years ♪

320
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:10,900
You can cry out if it hurts.

321
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:15,350
♪ Dreaming we meet again on the old road, watching you gently play the zither ♪

322
00:18:15,350 --> 00:18:16,160
Chamber pot.

323
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:17,550
I won't look.

324
00:18:19,410 --> 00:18:21,700
[Half a month later]

325
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:27,700
♪ For whom do the years wait on the strings to serve a pot of tea? ♪

326
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:46,640
You can get out of bed now. That's great.

327
00:18:48,750 --> 00:18:50,720
You'll be able to go home safe soon.

328
00:18:55,920 --> 00:18:56,440
I…

329
00:18:57,070 --> 00:18:58,590
I want to repay your kindness.

330
00:18:58,590 --> 00:18:59,650
Repay my kindness?

331
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:04,900
Everyone in this palace feels insecure.

332
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:05,880
You

333
00:19:05,900 --> 00:19:08,380
need to learn to protect yourself.

334
00:19:10,140 --> 00:19:10,970
Take this medicine.

335
00:19:10,970 --> 00:19:14,630
Your wound hasn't fully healed. Remember to change the dressing.

336
00:19:26,570 --> 00:19:29,240
I must not be trapped by these palace walls.

337
00:19:42,190 --> 00:19:43,030
Come back.

338
00:19:47,210 --> 00:19:48,940
What is he doing here every day?

339
00:19:49,210 --> 00:19:50,610
He still practices martial arts after his duties.

340
00:19:50,610 --> 00:19:51,470
Isn't he tired?

341
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:55,740
No matter how much he practices, he's still just a servant.

342
00:19:59,250 --> 00:20:00,420
At that time,

343
00:20:01,130 --> 00:20:03,190
I just wanted to get stronger quickly

344
00:20:03,590 --> 00:20:04,750
and protect her.

345
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:07,770
Servant Changyue,

346
00:20:07,770 --> 00:20:08,680
[Ten years later]

347
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:09,880
for your merit in saving the Emperor,

348
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:13,540
you are hereby appointed as a military officer of the Yulin Guard.

349
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:15,200
Raise your head.

350
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:17,770
What is your name?

351
00:20:18,970 --> 00:20:21,660
My name is Ningjia. You fool.

352
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:25,200
Ning…

353
00:20:26,650 --> 00:20:27,440
Ning Changyue.
